<div class="about">
  <div class="content">
    <h2>At 1Hour-After we are all about innovation.</h2>
    <h3>But we know that this cannot be done in a vacuum.<br/> We need the help of like minded people and athletes<br/> <i>(like yourselves).</i></h3>
    <p>Our goal is to build a community of trusted fitness individuals who can help us develop (& sell) novel products with immediate application to daily athletes, who are looking to push their limits and take care of their body & health.</p>

<p>Our affiliates will receive free samples of products throughout the creation stage and have the opportunity to provide feedback on how to improve the products for maximum efficiency. We will also take ideas on products that would be helpful to you in your daily and weekly routine to create the products that you and your community, want and need. As part of our commitment to supporting our affiliates, we also offer exclusive access to our sporting goods affiliate programs. These programs empower affiliates to share their experiences with our products and earn rewards for their contributions.</p>

<p>On top of this we will help support our affiliate members with the growth of their channels by assisting with content creation, providing free product for customer giveaways, sponsoring athletic training programs, or run clubs and other meaningful cross promotion tactics.</p>

<p>Collaborative innovation works both ways, and we want to build meaningful partnerships with the people who align with our core beliefs and vision. Our commitment extends to our athletic affiliate programs, where affiliates are recognized as integral members of our community. Through tailored support and meaningful engagement opportunities, affiliates can leverage their passion for athletics to drive positive change and inspire others to push their limit</p>
